 "name": "Session management functionality exposed to the browser Community Group",
 "is_closed": true,
 "creation-date": "2013-11-05",
 "description": "The mission of this group is to define a standard way to manage web sessions directly from the web browser. The web sites must expose a set of functionalities in every page served in order to make easy to browser plugins (and the browser itself) to manage the user session.",
